{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104715","id":2424550349,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Qg7PN","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104715","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104715.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104715.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104715","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104715/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104715/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104715/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4774b57e4d03f23a22fdd41a7db536f0c6158ef4","number":104715,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add auto-scroll behavior when selecting text outside the visible area in RichTextLabel","user":{"login":"Andrewyuan34","id":107494519,"node_id":"U_kgDOBmg8dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107494519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34","html_url":"https://github.com/Andrewyuan34","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary  \r\nThis PR improves the text selection experience by ensuring that when the user drags the mouse outside the visible text area, the content scrolls automatically in the appropriate direction.  \r\n\r\n## Changes  \r\n- Implemented smooth auto-scrolling when the cursor moves above or below the text area.  \r\n- Adjusted scroll speed dynamically based on the cursor's distance from the text area.  \r\n- Ensured that the selection properly updates to the last visible item when scrolling occurs.  \r\n\r\n## Why this is needed  \r\nPreviously, when selecting text beyond the visible bounds, the scroll behavior was either inconsistent or non-existent, making text selection difficult for larger documents. This PR enhances usability by ensuring a fluid scrolling experience.  \r\n\r\n## Testing  \r\n- Verified that scrolling works both upwards and downwards when dragging outside the visible text area.  \r\n- Ensured that selection updates correctly to the boundary item when scrolling.  \r\n- Tested with different text lengths and scroll speeds to maintain a smooth experience.  \r\n\r\n![GIF 3-28-2025 3-59-06 AM](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fac6fce6-aadd-42d3-bb4a-6a66723315c2)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB"